# (the user's, testing 1.5.0-beta2) a set stored from the computer into the set loaded didn't change what played:
# loading copies a set into the pieces, and a store replaces the stored copy only. Now its STORED outcome, then (once
# it's over, or taken away) LOAD IT NOW? (the Load knob's question: GLO yes, anything else no, 30 s; its yes LOADED);
# into another set, nothing more. The set loaded known from its load (APPLY, the Load knob); after a reboot, the set
# stored whose name the pieces carry. The music started meanwhile: STORED, load it to hear it. The reader's lines
listen
wait 600
tap PLAY
wait 400
expect playing 0
# (the sets the FM-1 comes with, stored at its first boot: deleted, an empty store as this test was made for)
setsdelete
expect setmask 0
# two versions of one set (Winter Set, five pieces): its first piece Morning, then Dawn
name 0 Morning
name -1 Winter Set
dub1set build/scenarios/loadagain/a.dub1 5
name 0 Dawn
dub1set build/scenarios/loadagain/b.dub1 5
name -1 Other
dub1set build/scenarios/loadagain/c.dub1 3 noglob
name 0 -
name -1 -
expectname 0 Basic
expect live 0
# stored into set 2, nothing loaded: STORED, nothing asked after it
setsend 1 build/scenarios/loadagain/a.dub1
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 100
setstate yes
outis STORED
wait 3300
expect outcome 0
expect asking 0
# loaded (the computer's APPLY): set 2 the set loaded, Morning playing
sxreq 30 0201 30
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 600
setstate yes
expect live 2
expectname 0 Morning
wait 3200
# the new version into set 2: STORED, then LOAD IT NOW? (not while the outcome is up)
setsend 1 build/scenarios/loadagain/b.dub1
wait 100
said STORE SET 2? Winter Set
tap GLO
wait 100
setstate yes
said STORE SET 2 STORED
outis STORED
shot again_stored.png
wait 2700
expect outcome 1
expect asking 0
wait 500
expect asking 48
expect again 1
setstate asking
said LOAD IT NOW? Winter Set. GLO yes, anything else no
shot again_ask.png
wait 28000
shot again_ask_late.png
# yes: loaded, Dawn now
tap GLO
wait 600
setstate yes
said LOAD SET 2 LOADED
outis LOADED
shot again_loaded.png
expectname 0 Dawn
expect setlen 5
expect dirty 0
expect live 2
workcheck
wait 3200
expect outcome 0
expect asking 0
# the old version back into set 2, the outcome taken away early (a key): asked at once; no (HOME): the pieces as they
# were (Dawn still), the set stored the old one
setsend 1 build/scenarios/loadagain/a.dub1
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 600
tapkey w3
wait 100
expect outcome 0
wait 100
expect asking 48
expect again 1
tap HOME
wait 100
setstate no
said LOAD SET 2 NOT LOADED
outis NOT LOADED
shot again_no.png
expectname 0 Dawn
expect view 0
wait 3200
expect outcome 0
# unanswered 30 s: NOT DONE, as any question
setsend 1 build/scenarios/loadagain/b.dub1
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 3200
expect asking 48
wait 30100
setstate timeout
outis NOT DONE
expectname 0 Dawn
wait 3200
# into another set (3): nothing asked after it
setsend 2 build/scenarios/loadagain/c.dub1
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 100
setstate yes
wait 3300
expect outcome 0
expect asking 0
# the music started (MIDI) while STORED shows: not asked; STORED again, load it to hear it
setsend 1 build/scenarios/loadagain/a.dub1
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 100
setstate yes
wait 1000
midi FA
wait 2400
expect asking 0
said STORE SET 2 LOAD IT TO HEAR IT
outis STORED
shot again_playing.png
midi FC
wait 3200
expect outcome 0
expect asking 0
tap PLAY
wait 300
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect playing 0
# after a reboot the set loaded isn't known: the set stored whose name the pieces carry (Winter Set: set 2), asked
reboot
wait 300
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect playing 0
expect live 0
expectname 0 Dawn
setsend 1 build/scenarios/loadagain/b.dub1
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 3300
expect asking 48
expect again 1
tap GLO
wait 600
setstate yes
expect live 2
wait 3200
# the computer's question meanwhile (a DELETE while STORED shows): LOAD IT NOW? not asked after it
setsend 1 build/scenarios/loadagain/a.dub1
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 300
sxreq 31 0202 31
wait 100
expect asking 49
tap HOME
wait 3300
expect asking 0
expect outcome 0
# set 2 deleted: no set loaded; stored again into set 2: nothing asked
sxreq 31 0201 31
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 100
setstate yes
expect live 0
wait 3200
setsend 1 build/scenarios/loadagain/b.dub1
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 3300
expect asking 0
sethas 1 Winter Set
# the Load knob's load: set 2 the set loaded again
tap GLO
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 600
expect view 28
spin K4 1
wait 1400
expect asking 48
expect again 0
said LOAD SET 2? Winter Set
tap GLO
wait 600
setstate yes
expect live 2
